Swapnil S/O Nanaji Ingole And Others vs State Of Maharashtra, Thr. Secretary, ... on 6 January, 2026
Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/121706453/

1 (d) direct the respondent No.2-District Collector, Amravati to pay the rental compensation to the petitioners on account of the excess land of the petitioners admeasuring 1.63 H.R. from Gat No.65/1 of Mouza Aadegaon (Khurd), covered under the road constructed by respondent No.3-MADC with interest at the rate of 18% per annum 2 WP-4783-2022.odt from 15/03/2017 till the date issuance of section 11 notification to be issued for acquisition of said excess land, forthwith;
(e) direct the respondent No.3 MADC to pay the compensation to petitioners on account of damages caused to their crops from the land i.e. Gat No.65/1, Muza Aadegaon (Khurd), as assessed by the expert from Agricultural Department at Annexures-R & R-1 dated 1.3.2021 & 27.7.2021, forthwith;
(f) hold and declare that the petitioners are entitled for getting compensation with interest at the rate of 18% per annum;
(g) allow this petition with costs; and (h) grant any other suitable relief to which the petitioners are entitled in the facts and circumstances of the present case."
2. Admittedly, the petitioners before filing the present petition approached the Collector with similar prayers and till this date, there is no decision on such representation by the Collector.
3.

